# Amazon Ads API local backend secrets -- never commit. Already covered by
# *.local above; listed explicitly too since this file holds a Client
# Secret and refresh token and deserves an unambiguous, defense-in-depth
# entry rather than relying solely on the general pattern matching it.
.env.amazon.local
server/.env.amazon.local

